\"", "k": "say", "d": 1.3}, {"a": 185.0, "b": 190.6, "s": "I finally arrived in Israel.", "k": "say", "d": 3.2}, {"a": 191.91, "b": 193.9, "s": "I went to a restaurant.", "k": "say", "d": 0.9}, {"a": 194.2, "b": 199.6, "s": "I asked for something kosher.", "k": "say", "d": 1.6}, {"a": 199.86, "b": 202.1, "s": "The waiter brought me a sandwich.", "k": "say", "d": 1.1}, {"a": 202.26, "b": 205.6, "s": "No questions.", "k": "say", "d": 0.8}, {"a": 205.88, "b": 207.3, "s": "No investigation.", "k": "say", "d": 0.7}, {"a": 207.5, "b": 210.1, "s": "Just a sandwich.", "k": "say", "d": 1.2}, {"a": 210.4, "b": 212.7, "s": "Very nice.", "k": "say", "d": 0.7}, {"a": 30.2, "b": 31.830000000000002, "s": "Monday in Pyongyang,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 31.87, "b": 33.550000000000004, "s": "everything was fine.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 33.59, "b": 34.69, "s": "Tuesday at the museum,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 34.73, "b": 36.93, "s": "standing in a line.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 36.97, "b": 38.65, "s": "Wednesday at the restaurant,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 38.69, "b": 40.03, "s": "chicken on the plate.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 40.07, "b": 41.550000000000004, "s": "I asked for something kosher,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 41.59, "b": 43.13, "s": "then everybody wait.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 43.17, "b": 46.050000000000004, "s": "The waiter stopped writing.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 46.09, "b": 49.36, "s": "Mister Kim stopped too.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 49.4, "b": 52.0, "s": "I said I'm Jewish.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 52.04, "b": 54.86, "s": "He put down his spoon.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 81.0, "b": 82.63, "s": "Thursday at the office,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 82.67, "b": 83.89, "s": "questions all day long.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 83.93, "b": 85.58999999999999, "s": "They asked me who had sent me,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 85.63, "b": 86.91, "s": "then said nothing was wrong.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 86.95, "b": 88.66999999999999, "s": "They took away my passport,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 88.71, "b": 90.36, "s": "they cancelled all my plans.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 90.4, "b": 91.96, "s": "One man watched the doorway,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 92.0, "b": 93.67999999999999, "s": "another watched the man.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 93.72, "b": 96.97999999999999, "s": "I asked for some breakfast.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 97.02, "b": 100.46, "s": "They told me to wait.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 100.5, "b": 102.74, "s": "The food was approved,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 102.78, "b": 105.46, "s": "but the spoon was delayed.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 146.66, "b": 148.3, "s": "Saturday morning,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 148.34, "b": 149.96, "s": "ready at 5.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 150.0, "b": 151.28, "s": "Waiting at the airport,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 151.32, "b": 152.54000000000002, "s": "hoping for a flight.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 152.58, "b": 154.18, "s": "One man said I could leave,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 154.22, "b": 155.86, "s": "another disagreed.", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 155.9, "b": 157.28, "s": "They argued for an hour,", "k": "sub"}, {"a": 157.32, "b": 158.66, "s": "then returned my ID.", "k": "sub"}], "total": 227.6}